:: choosing_wren_shows_her_secret_and_no_one_elses [test]
start: cast
do: "Wren Hollis"
expect: me.is(wren)
expect text: "you lifted a brass key from the Professor’s pocket"
expect no text: "you saw Miss Vell slip out"
do: "Board the train"
expect at: lounge@0
expect text: "Each of you still wears one of his prototypes, ticking."
expect link: "Examine the body"

:: rook_remembers_what_he_saw [test]
start: cast
do: "Captain Rook"
do: "Board the train"
expect text: "In the dark you are sure of one thing: Miss Vell slipped out a moment before."

:: the_letter_question_waits_for_the_blueprint [test]
start: dining@1
~ as rook
expect no link: "Ask Mrs. Ardent about her letter"
do: "Unroll the blueprint"
expect: me.knows.two_hands
expect: rook.vults == 2
expect link: "Ask Mrs. Ardent about her letter"
do: "Ask Mrs. Ardent about her letter"
expect text: "It is for my solicitor"
expect: rook.vults == 0

:: only_wren_may_lift_the_letter [test]
start: dining@1
~ as wren
expect link: "Lift her letter"
as: rook
expect no link: "Lift her letter"

:: a_taken_cufflink_stops_glinting [test]
start: dining@1
~ as wren
expect text: "Something glints beside the sugar bowl."
do: "Pocket the glint"
expect: me.holds.cufflink
expect: cufflink.taken
start: dining@2
expect no text: "Something still glints"

:: sallow_reads_the_bruise [test]
start: lounge@1
~ as sallow
do: "Examine the body"
expect: me.knows.scorched_wrist and me.knows.bruise
expect text: "the bruise at his temple is wrong"

:: anyone_else_only_sees_the_burn [test]
start: lounge@1
~ as ada
do: "Examine the body"
expect: me.knows.scorched_wrist and not me.knows.bruise

:: the_colonel_talks_differently_by_stop [test]
start: sleeper@1
~ as ada
do: "Talk with the Colonel"
expect text: "Had a girl in the workshop for that."
start: sleeper@3
expect no link: "Talk with the Colonel"
expect no link: "Wake the Colonel"
as: rook
expect link: "Wake the Colonel"

:: a_watch_winds_only_once [test]
start: baggage@1
~ as ada
expect: ada.rewinds == 2
do: "Wind your watch at the generator"
expect text: "One more charge."
expect: ada.rewinds == 3 and ada.wound_watch
start: baggage@2
expect no link: "Wind your watch at the generator"

:: vell_goes_to_burn_the_notebook [test]
start: lounge@0 ~ as rook
expect: vell.in(lounge)
do: "Go to the dining car"
expect: vell.in(dining)
expect: notebook.exists
do: "Go to the sleeper car"
expect: vell.in(sleeper)
expect: not notebook.exists

:: vell_silences_a_lone_holder_of_evidence [test]
start: lounge@0 ~ as rook
given: gain notebook
do: "Go to the baggage car"
expect: vell.in(baggage)
expect: not rook.dead
do: "Stay"
expect text: "Your watch fires"
expect: not rook.dead
expect: rook.knows.the_attack
expect: rook.rewinds == 1
expect: me.past
expect: clock.now == 1
expect at: baggage@1

:: with_no_charge_left_vell_s_victim_stays_dead [test]
start: lounge@0 ~ as rook
given: gain notebook
given: lower rewinds 2
do: "Go to the baggage car"
do: "Stay"
expect: rook.dead
expect: rook.knows.the_attack
expect no text: "Your watch fires"
expect: not rook.holds.notebook ~ ((the dead hold nothing))
expect: notebook.in(baggage) ~ ((it lies where he fell))
expect: rook.knows.notebook ~ ((but he knows he had it))

:: two_hands_on_the_cufflink [test]
start: dining@1 ~ as rook, wren
do: "Pocket the glint"
expect text: "(Waiting to see whether anyone else here reaches for it.)"
expect no link: "Pocket the glint"
as: wren
do: "Pocket the glint"
expect text: "Captain Hal Rook, retired reached for it at the same moment."
expect: rook.holds.cufflink or wren.holds.cufflink
expect: not (rook.holds.cufflink and wren.holds.cufflink)
expect: rook.vults == 2 and wren.vults == 2
as: rook
expect text: "Wren Hollis, investor reached for it at the same moment."

:: a_claim_settles_when_the_rival_moves_on [test]
start: dining@1 ~ as rook, wren
do: "Pocket the glint"
expect no text: "A silver cufflink"
as: wren
do: "Stay"
as: rook
expect text: "A silver cufflink, monogrammed E.V."
expect no text: "at the same moment"
expect: rook.holds.cufflink

:: everyone_moves_at_once [test]
start: lounge@0 ~ as ada, rook
expect text: "Ada Thorne, financier, Captain Hal Rook, retired, Miss Edith Vell are here."
do: "Stay"
expect text: "(Waiting for the others.)"
expect no link: "Go to the dining car"
expect: clock.now == 0
as: rook
do: "Go to the dining car"
expect: clock.now == 1
expect at: dining@1
as: ada
expect at: lounge@1
expect text: "Captain Hal Rook, retired leaves for the dining car."
expect link: "Go to the dining car"

:: a_dash_is_seen_wherever_it_passes [test]
start: dining@1 ~ as wren, ada
do: "Dash to the baggage car"
as: ada
do: "Go to the observation lounge"
expect at: lounge@2
expect text: "Wren Hollis, investor runs through, toward the baggage car."
as: wren
expect at: baggage@2

:: only_some_may_dash_or_slip [test]
start: dining@1 ~ as rook, wren
expect no link: "Dash to the baggage car"
expect no link: "Slip to the observation lounge"
as: wren
expect link: "Dash to the baggage car"
expect link: "Slip to the observation lounge"

:: turning_the_watch_back_re_lives_a_stop [test]
start: lounge@0 ~ as rook
do: "Go to the dining car"
do: "Go to the observation lounge"
expect: clock.now == 2
expect link: "Turn your watch back"
do: "Turn your watch back"
expect link: "Back one stop"
expect link: "Back 2 stops"
do: "Back one stop"
expect at: dining@1
expect: me.past
expect: clock.now == 1
expect text: "Your echo stands at the bar"
expect no link: "Pocket the glint"
expect no link: "Turn your watch back"
do: "Unroll the blueprint"
expect: me.knows.two_hands
expect: rook.vults == 3
do: "Go to the observation lounge"
expect text: "You are back in the present."
expect: not me.past
expect at: lounge@2
expect: clock.now == 2
expect: rook.rewinds == 1
expect: me.knows.two_hands


:: the_guest_names_themself [test]
start: cast
do: "Someone else"
expect text: "(Type a name, up to 24 letters.)"
expect no link: "Board the train"
answer: "Marguerite Ashdown"
expect link: "Board the train"
do: "Board the train"
expect text: "Marguerite Ashdown. Nobody quite remembers inviting you."

:: the_jury_convicts_with_proof [test]
start: terminus ~ as ada, rook
given: gain cufflink
expect text: "(Vote: who, of Mrs. Cora Ardent, Mr. Crane or Miss Edith Vell; how, of device, poison or fall; and cite your proof.)"
vote: vell ~ how device ~ proof cufflink
expect text: "(Your ballot is cast. Waiting for the others.)"
expect no link: "Hear the verdict"
as: rook
vote: vell ~ how device
expect no text: "The ballots are revealed" ~ ((Ex 1 frames the tally itself))
expect: accusation.done and accusation.correct and accusation.proven
do: "Hear the verdict"
expect text: "The foreman reads out the ballots: 2 for Miss Edith Vell, by device."
expect text: "two constables are waiting"

:: right_but_unproven [test]
start: terminus ~ as ada, rook
vote: vell ~ how device
as: rook
vote: vell ~ how device
expect: accusation.correct and not accusation.proven
do: "Hear the verdict"
expect text: "Without proof she is free to go"

:: a_hung_jury_votes_once_more [test]
start: terminus ~ as ada, rook
vote: vell ~ how device
as: rook
vote: crane ~ how poison
expect text: "(The jury is hung. Vote again.)"
expect: not accusation.done
vote: crane ~ how poison
as: ada
vote: vell ~ how device
expect: accusation.done and accusation.hung and not accusation.correct
do: "Hear the verdict"
expect text: "The foreman reads out the ballots: 1 for Miss Edith Vell, by device; 1 for Mr. Crane, by poison."

:: the_last_stop_ends_at_the_terminus [test]
start: lounge@5 ~ as ada, rook
expect no link: "Go to the dining car"
do: "Stay"
as: rook
do: "Stay"
expect at: terminus
expect text: "The night express sighs into Kingsgate at dawn"
as: ada
expect at: terminus

:: only_linkers_and_awake_witnesses_spoil_being_alone [test]
(((
Vell kills only when no other Linker and no awake witness is in the car.
Hobbs, always awake, keeps the dining car safe; Mrs. Ardent is no witness.
)))
start: dining@1 ~ as rook
given: move vell to dining
expect: not alone_with(vell, rook) ~ ((Hobbs is watching))
given: move hobbs to lounge
expect: alone_with(vell, rook) ~ ((Mrs. Ardent does not count))

:: two_hands_on_the_cufflink_seeded [test]
(((
Two investors reach for the same cufflink in the same stop. Exactly one
gets it, both pay for trying, and each hears who else reached.
)))
seed: 7
start: dining@1 ~ as rook, wren
given: learn two_hands ~ ((Rook has already read the blueprint))
do: "Pocket the glint"
expect text: "(Waiting to see whether anyone else here reaches for it.)"
expect no link: "Pocket the glint"
as: wren
do: "Pocket the glint"
expect text: "reached for it at the same moment"
expect: rook.holds.cufflink or wren.holds.cufflink
expect: not (rook.holds.cufflink and wren.holds.cufflink)
expect: rook.vults == 2 and wren.vults == 2

:: a_ghost_cites_what_it_once_held [test]
(((
Ada finds the cufflink, dies with no charge left, and still convicts Vell
as a ghost: the cufflink fell where she died, but she knows it.
)))
start: terminus ~ as ada, rook
given: gain cufflink
given: lower rewinds 2
given: kill ada
expect: ada.dead and not ada.holds.cufflink
vote: vell ~ how device ~ proof cufflink
as: rook
vote: vell ~ how device
expect: accusation.proven
